  "sourceTitle": "French Quarter Sauce",
  "sourceText": "French Quarter Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 11:31pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Onion, grated\n1/4 cup Salad oil\n1 8 oz can tomato sauce\n1/2 cup Water\n1/4 cup Brown sugar\n1/4 cup Lemon juice\n3 tablespoons Worcestershire sauce\n2 tablespoons Prepared mustard\n2 teaspoons Salt\n1/4 teaspoon Pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook onion in hot oil until tender. Add remaining ingredients; simmer uncovered 15 minutes. 2 Makes enough sauce to baste 4 pounds loin back ribs or spareribs.",
